OL,7,G0855 Four in a Bed
OL,8,     FThe first visit of the week is to
OL,9,     FThe Lazy Pug in Warwickshire, run
OL,10,     Fby best friends Ash and Rosie,
OL,11,     Fwhere the quirky decor and neon
OL,12,     Flighting give some of the guests a
OL,13,     Fheadache.
OL,14,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,15,     FThe B&Bers head to Cardiff to stay
OL,16,     Fat Crofts Hotel, run by chef
OL,17,     FLorraine. They're all expecting a
OL,18,     Fknockout breakfast, but uninvited
OL,19,     Fguests ruin things for some of
OL,20,     Fthem.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/13
