OL,5,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FAnthony hosts the week's third
OL,7,     Fvisit at The Hollybush Inn, in
OL,8,     FWarwickshire. His 16th-century
OL,9,     Fcoaching inn wows the guests with
OL,10,     Fits history. But some think the
OL,11,     Fcleanliness needs updating.
OL,12,G1030 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe B&Bers go glamping in the
OL,14,     Fweek's last visit, at The Pretty
OL,15,     FThing glampsite in Essex. Ash and
OL,16,     FRosie embrace the luxe of their
OL,17,     FAztec tent before host Phil serves
OL,18,     Fhis first-ever breakfast.
