OL,6,     FIt's payment day, and the B&Bers
OL,7,     Freconvene to feud about
OL,8,     Ffacilities, bicker over beds and
OL,9,     Fcross swords over sausages, before
OL,10,     Fthe payments are revealed and the
OL,11,     Fwinner is announced.
OL,12,G1135 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FSheffield area. The first host,
OL,14,     Fchocolate shop manager and
