OL,12,G1340 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FSheffield area. Psychologist Abi
OL,14,     Fhosts the final night with a
OL,15,     Ftravel-inspired Asian menu, a
OL,16,     Flesson in sock puppetry, and some
OL,17,     Fcontroversial burning-hot chilli
OL,18,     Fsauce. (Ep5/5)
