OL,5,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FMalcolm and Fiona hope to show
OL,7,     Ftheir guests an alternative way of
OL,8,     Flife at The Old Mill House in
OL,9,     FBridport, Dorset. But some aren't
OL,10,     Fconvinced and the meditation
OL,11,     Fsession gets a mixed response.
OL,12,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FRachel and Dan Lonergan host at
OL,14,     FThe Brighton Inn, where the guests
OL,15,     Fclown around as they learn some
OL,16,     Fcircus skills. But some of them
OL,17,     Fare on the offensive...
